@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "zendesk.integration"

Feature: OSB to Zendesk User Mobile Number Integration
	Testing user mobile phone number sync updates in Zendesk caused by changes in OSB and web.

Setup:
	* I generate a provisioning project name
	* I create a user with the following parameters
	| Screen Name   | zen.phonenumber1                       |
	| Email Address | zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | ZEN                                    |
	| Last Name     | Phonenumber1                           |
	* I generate static start and end dates
	* I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code   | PHONEZPHONEZ                  | |
	| Name   | Phonez - ${staticProjectName} | |
	| Region | United States                 | |
	| Status | Active                        | |
	| Tier   | T1                            | |
	* I assign the contact with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on the account "Phonez - ${staticProjectName}" to the following roles
	| Support Requester |
	* I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Phonez - ${staticProjectName}" and the product "Portal Production" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}         |   |
	| Original End Date       | ${staticOriginalEndDate} |   |
	| Perpetual               | false                    |   |
	| Product Field and Value | sizing                   | 1 |
	| Product Field and Value | licenses                 | 1 |
	| Product Field and Value | version                  | 6 |
	| Quantity                | 1                        |   |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate}       |   |
	| Status                  | Approved                 |   |
	* I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Phonez - ${staticProjectName}" and the product "Gold Subscription" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}         | |
	| Original End Date       | ${staticOriginalEndDate} | |
	| Perpetual               | false                    | |
	| Quantity                | 1                        | |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate}       | |
	| Status                  | Approved                 | |
	* I synchronize the account entitlement definition with the name "Gold Subscription"
	* I wait for "30" seconds
	* the support organization with the code "PHONEZPHONEZ" should be part of the support site
	* the organization "Phonez - ${staticProjectName}" should be present on zendesk.liferay.com
	* the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be present on zendesk.liferay.com
	* the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be present via the external id search api on zendesk.liferay.com

Teardown:
	* I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Primary Number | |
	| Mobile Number  | |
	* I wait for "30" seconds
	* I get the ID of the default user belonging to the organization "Phonez - ${staticProjectName}" from zendesk.liferay.com
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Phonez - ${staticProjectName} |
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following "Code" values
	| PHONEZPHONEZ |
	* I synchronize the account entitlement definition with the name "Gold Subscription"
	* I tear down the projects with the following project codes via groovy
	| PHONEZPHONEZ |
	* I tear down the users with the following screen names from okta
	| zen.phonenumber1 |
	* I tear down the users with the following email addresses from okta
	| zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	* I tear down the users with the following email addresses from customer.liferay.com
	| zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	* I tear down the users with the following email addresses from koroneiki
	| zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	* I tear down the users with the following screen names from koroneiki
	| zen.phonenumber1 |
	* I tear down the contacts on koroneiki with the following email addresses
	| zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	* I obtain the IDs of the following user email addresses from zendesk.liferay.com
	| zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	* I teardown users with the following userIds "${staticUserIdList}" from zendesk.liferay.com
	* I obtain the external IDs of the following organizations from zendesk.liferay.com if still present
	| Phonez - ${staticProjectName} |
	* I teardown organizations with the following organizationExternalIds "${staticOrganizationExternalIdList}" from zendesk.liferay.com
	* I teardown the user with userId "${staticDefaultUserId}" from zendesk.liferay.com

Scenario: View user phone number update
	@ help.center.acceptance = "true"
	OSB user phone number updates to details on web should sync properly to Zendesk.

	Given I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | +15558402834 |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should have the phone number "+15558402834"
	Then I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | 5559873461 |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should have the phone number "+15558402834"
	Then I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | +15554394671 |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should have the phone number "+15554394671"

Scenario: View user phone number delete
	OSB user phone number deletions to details on web should sync properly to Zendesk.

	Given I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | +15558402834 |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should have the phone number "+15558402834"
	When I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should not have the phone number "+15558402834"

Scenario: View user phone number with no country code update
	OSB user phone numbers with no country code updates to details on web should not sync to Zendesk.

	Given I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | 5558402834 |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should not have the phone number "5558402834"

Scenario: View user phone number from no country code to country code update
	OSB user phone numbers that go from no country code to country code on web should sync to Zendesk.

	Given I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | 5558402834 |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should not have the phone number "5558402834"
	When I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | +15554394671 |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should have the phone number "+15554394671"
	And the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should not have the phone number "5558402834"

Scenario: View user phone number from no country code to deletion to country code update
	OSB user phone numbers that go from no country code to deletion to country code on web should sync to Zendesk.

	Given I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | 5558402834 |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should not have the phone number "5558402834"
	When I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should not have the phone number "5558402834"
	When I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | +15554394671 |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should have the phone number "+15554394671"

Scenario: View user phone number from country code to deletion to no country code update
	OSB user phone numbers that go from country code to deletion to no country code on web should not sync to Zendesk.

	Given I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | +15554394671 |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should have the phone number "+15554394671"
	When I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should not have the phone number "+15554394671"
	When I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | 5558402834 |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should not have the phone number "5558402834"

Scenario: View user phone number with two non country code updates
	OSB user phone numbers with two non country code updates to details on web should not sync to Zendesk.

	Given I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | 5558402834 |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should not have the phone number "5558402834"
	When I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | 5557496334 |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should not have the phone number "5557496334"

Scenario: View user phone number with two country code updates
	OSB user phone numbers with two country code updates to details on web should sync properly to Zendesk.

	Given I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | +15558402834 |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should have the phone number "+15558402834"
	When I update a user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" using following parameters
	| Mobile Number | +15554394671 |
	And I wait for "30" seconds
	Then the user with the email address "zen.phonenumber1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should have the phone number "+15554394671"